    "caption": "Students participating in the academic mobility program from\nAzerbaijan State Oil and Industry University\nvisited Mangystau Hub 🚀\n\nMangystau Hub is a leading regional innovation space where startup ideas are born, teams are formed, and projects evolve from early-stage concepts into funded initiatives. Many regional ideas begin here and successfully move toward investment and real implementation.\n\nDuring the visit, the students explored the startup ecosystem, discussed innovation development in the Mangystau region, and exchanged perspectives on international collaboration in IT and technology.\n\nNew connections, valuable insights, and fresh inspiration — another step toward building strong international partnerships. 🌍",
